list.item:
Anti-Ballistic Missiles (ABMs)—i.e., missiles constructed for an ABM role, deployed in conjunction with other
    ABM components, or of a type
indistinguishable from missiles tested in an ABM role;


    ABM radars—i.e., radars constructed
for an ABM role, deployed with other ABM components, or of a type indistinguishable
from radars tested in an ABM role;
